{"pageid":5245,"title":"Root Froot","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Root Froot</span>","revid":22157,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"><i><b>Description</b></i></span></h2>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Raw and Jammed Root Froot</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Root.png/revision/latest?cb=20260821225341\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Root\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Root.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20260821225341\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Root.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20260821225341 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Root.png/revision/latest?cb=20260821225341 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Root\" width=\"270\" height=\"243\" data-image-key=\"Root.png\" data-image-name=\"Root.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater Island (River Cave)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Grants Levitation for 7 - 10 seconds.</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Version 118.0 on May 30, 2026</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n<i><b>''Can be eaten for a short levitation effect.''</b></i>\n</p><p><b>Root Froot</b> is a consumable in <i>Oaklands</i>. It is primarily gathered to create preserves or used directly for its <b>unique mobility effects</b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Spawning_.26_Location\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Spawning_&amp;_Location\"><i>Spawning &amp; Location</i></span></h2>\n<p>Found underground within the <a href=\"/wiki/Lumite\" title=\"Lumite\">Lumite</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/River_Caves\" title=\"River Caves\">River Cave</a> networks.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Grows exclusively on the branches of <b>Root Trees.</b></li></ul>\n<ul><li>A single Root Tree spawns between <b>1 and 10</b> individual Root Froots.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Regrows over time along with tree node resets.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Economics_.26_Processing\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Economics_&amp;_Processing\"><i>Economics &amp; Processing</i></span></h2>\n<ul><li>$180 when sold raw.</li>\n<li>$720 when processed in a Canning Station.</li>\n<li>Processing Root Froot into jams offers one of the highest profit multipliers. (4x raw value)</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Player_Effects_.26_Gameplay_Use\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Player_Effects_&amp;_Gameplay_Use\"><i>Player Effects &amp; Gameplay Use</i></span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Raw Consumption</b> Grants a short <b>Levitation</b> effect when the player jumps, lasting roughly 7 to 10 seconds.</li>\n<li><b>Jarred Consumption</b> Grants an extended <b>Air Swimming</b> effect, allowing vertical and horizontal directional movement through the air for approximately 40 seconds.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Notes.28cons.26pros.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes(cons&amp;pros)\">Notes(cons&amp;pros)</span></h2>\n<ul><li>It is not worth to grind it for money.</li>\n<li>It's difficult to acquire at first, but once you get it, it's easy.</li>\n<li>Levitation is good for collecting <a href=\"/wiki/Celestial_Blossom\" title=\"Celestial Blossom\">Celestial Blossom</a>.</li>\n<li>Jam version is an early-stage plane/helicopter for flying but its slow.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903113059\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 66/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 29/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 75/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019518/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00